# FRACTINT | Island2 { ; Adrian Mariano
# FRACTINT | ; from The Fractal Geometry of Nature by Mandelbrot
# FRACTINT |   angle 4
# FRACTINT |   axiom f+f+f+f
# FRACTINT |   f=f+gf-ff-f-ff+g+ff-gf+ff+f+ff-g-fff
# FRACTINT |   g=@6G@I6
# FRACTINT |   }
